# Copy to `.env.local` and adjust. Large intro MP4s stay gitignored — see docs/CUTSCENE_MEDIA.md.

# Intro uses intro-player.html + intro_davinci.mp4 (local in dev, release CDN in prod).
# VITE_LH_INTRO_CINEMATIC_SRC=assets/intro/intro-player.html
# VITE_LH_INTRO_VIDEO_URL=assets/intro/intro_davinci.web.mp4

# Production: host MP4 on GitHub Release (see docs/CUTSCENE_MEDIA.md), then set:
# VITE_LH_MEDIA_BASE_URL=https://github.com/585swinemerchant/legendary-horizon-demo/releases/download/intro-media-v1/
